# POLYEDIT-2: UE PolyEdit Bridge, Collapse Edge, Extrude (open) Edge and Flip, each one undo step
# (MeshSelectionOperations -> Geometry MeshElementOperation BridgeSelection / CollapseSelection /
# ExtrudeEdgeSelection / FlipSelection). A 100 cm Box 60 cm above the origin (clear of the ground), PolyEdit level. The front (+Z) and back (-Z)
# faces are inset 25 cm first - bridging the cube's own faces would lay the tube on its outer walls - then the two
# inner faces are bridged into a tunnel. The +X+Z vertical edge is collapsed. Extrude Edge works on OPEN edges (as
# UE's), so the top face is deleted first and the back ring's top edge is extruded 25 cm. The -X face is flipped.
# Fourteen undo steps bring the cube back: the six mesh edits (Inset, Bridge, Collapse, Delete, Extrude Edge,
# Flip) and, between them, the four selection-mode switches and four picks (each an undo step, as UE's selection
# transactions); the editor.log [History] lines name each one.
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.6,-0.45,0.65
Дано run Modeling "Create shape pivot: Centre"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,60,0
Дано run Entity Box
Дано run Modeling "Select Elements tool"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection level: PolyEdit"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection mode: PolyGroup"
Дано --subject modeling set Element.Distance 25
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,0,-1
Дано run "Level Viewport" "Focus Selected"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: pick at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,0,1
Дано run "Level Viewport" "Focus Selected"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh selection: add pick at the viewport centre"
Дано run Modeling "Mesh operation: Inset"
Когда run Modeling "Mesh operation: Bridge"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 40,75,-230
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.17,-0.065,0.98
Тогда-вид 1_bridge a square tunnel 50 x 50 cm runs straight through the cube from the front face to the back one; the background is seen through it, its four inner walls are lit and solid
Когда run Modeling "Mesh selection mode: Edge"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.7,0,-0.7
Когда run "Level Viewport" "Focus Selected"
Когда run Modeling "Mesh selection: pick at the viewport centre"
Когда run Modeling "Mesh operation: Collapse"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 200,180,200
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.66,-0.4,-0.66
Тогда-вид 2_collapse the cube's front-right vertical edge is gone: its two ends meet in one point half way up, the faces beside it slope into that point; no crack or hole opens, the tunnel is still there
Когда run Modeling "Mesh selection mode: PolyGroup"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-1,0.05
Когда run "Level Viewport" "Focus Selected"
Когда run Modeling "Mesh selection: pick at the viewport centre"
Когда run Modeling "Mesh operation: Delete"
Когда run Modeling "Mesh selection mode: Edge"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.7,0.714
Когда run "Level Viewport" "Focus Selected"
Когда run Modeling "Mesh selection: pick at the viewport centre"
Когда run Modeling "Mesh operation: Extrude Edge"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position -220,170,-160
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.77,-0.31,0.56
Тогда-вид 3_extrude_edge_minusz the top face is open; seen from -Z: if the extruded edge is the -Z wall's top edge a flat strip 25 cm tall rises straight up, continuing the back wall above the cube
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position -160,190,230
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.54,-0.37,-0.76
Тогда-вид 3_extrude_edge the same mesh seen from +Z: the top face is open and one wall's top edge carries a flat strip 25 cm tall rising straight up, continuing that wall above the cube
Когда run Modeling "Mesh selection mode: PolyGroup"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 1,0,0.05
Когда run "Level Viewport" "Focus Selected"
Когда run Modeling "Mesh selection: pick at the viewport centre"
Когда run Modeling "Mesh operation: Flip"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position -230,120,-80
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.92,-0.24,0.32
Тогда-вид 4_flip the left (-X) face is turned inside out: seen from outside it shows its back side (culled or dark), the cube's inside is visible through it
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда run Action Undo
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position -200,170,-200
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.66,-0.4,0.66
Тогда-вид 5_undo after fourteen Undo the closed 100 cm cube is back: no tunnel, no collapsed edge, top face present, no strip, every face lit from outside
